# Nothing below is required. `npm run refresh` works with zero configuration
# and $0 cost — ingestion, deduplication, clustering, categorization, and
# team/player detection are all deterministic (no AI).
#
# The lines below only matter if you deliberately want to wire in an
# optional future AI-enrichment pass (scripts/lib/ai.js, not currently
# called by anything). Two separate opt-ins are required before any paid
# API call can happen — leave USE_ANTHROPIC unset and nothing ever gets
# billed, even if a key is present.

# USE_ANTHROPIC=true
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your-anthropic-api-key
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5
